<title>UK: RTZ tracks gains in RTZ-CRA in Sydney.</title>
<headline>RTZ tracks gains in RTZ-CRA in Sydney.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in RTZ Corp rose, tracking gains in the shares of its Australian mining partner RTZ-CRA overnight, traders said.</p>
<p>By 1228 GMT, RTZ shares were up 11-1/2p to 985p.</p>
<p>In Sydney, shares in RTZ-CRA gained A$0.52 to A$19.72, the highest level since early July. Other mining shares also advanced, lending support to shares in RTZ, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
